<title>USA: Sanderson Farms plant fire under control.</title>
<headline>Sanderson Farms plant fire under control.</headline>
<dateline>LAUREL, Miss. 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sanderson Farms Inc said on Wednesday there was a fire at its processing plant in McComb, Miss., which now has been brought under control.</p>
<p>The company said it is evaluating the cause of the fire and the extent of the damage. The property insurance maintained to cover the facility should substantially cover any required repairs or reconstruction, Sanderson said.</p>
<p>The company said the fire started overnight and no one was injured.</p>
